! The general profile's custom rules for AdGuard Home: none (design decision 62).
! generic-tv blocks only what its two subscribed lists block ([adguard] filters in generic-tv.toml), since
! nothing is known about the TV behind it. A rule pinned here would block a name for every brand of TV at
! once; a TV whose names are known gets a profile of its own (docs/project/adding-a-profile.md).
